"pageType\":\"game\",\"path\":\"\u002Fzh\u002Fg\u002Fguns-guns-guns\",\"site\":{\"domain\":\"poki.com\",\"domain_title\":\"Poki.com\",\"id\":73,\"iso_lang\":\"zh\",\"lang\":\"zh\",\"languageName\":\"简体中文\",\"locale\":\"zh_CN\",\"paths\":{\"prefix\":\"\u002Fzh\"},\"title\":\"Poki (宝玩)\"},\"slug\":\"guns-guns-guns\"})":{"status":"fulfilled","endpointName":"getGame","requestId":"iCYC7FtIqyoUAsgLe88Lw","originalArgs":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","site":{"id":73,"lang":"zh","title":"Poki (宝玩)","languageName":"简体中文","domain":"poki.com","domain_title":"Poki.com","iso_lang":"zh","locale":"zh_CN","paths":{"prefix":"\u002Fzh"}},"device":"desktop","geo":"CN","experiment":"control-969a0f4b","pageType":"game","path":"\u002Fzh\u002Fg\u002Fguns-guns-guns"},"startedTimeStamp":1785474062035,"data":{"id":32058,"developer":"CHEPERGame","developers":["CHEPERGame"],"fullscreen":false,"allow_smart_refresh":true,"desktop_available":true,"mobile_available":true,"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns","english_title":"Guns Guns Guns","intro":"Guns Guns Guns 是一款射击游戏，玩家置身于战术军事场景中。踏上战场，从逼真武器库中选择你的武器，与小队合作，在竞技场比赛中击败对手。","description":"\u003Cp\u003E\n《枪枪枪》是一款数字游戏，你的任务很简单——赚取更多金币，升级你的枪支！从基础装备开始，选择正确的路线来提升收入，并在每个关卡的最后消灭怪物。不断升级，不断射击，看着你的火力在每一轮都变得更强。准备好积累金币，打造终极武器库了吗？\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\u003Ch3\u003E如何玩《枪枪枪》？\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\n使用A\u002FD键、左右方向键或摇杆移动。点击射击！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\u003Ch3\u003E谁创造了《枪枪枪》？\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\n《枪枪枪》由 CHEPERGame 开发。玩玩他们的其他游戏吧！ Poki (宝玩)： \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fpoki.com\u002Fzh\u002Fg\u002Felemental-master\"\u003EElemental Master\u003C\u002Fa\u003E！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\n\u003Ch3\u003E如何免费玩《枪战枪战》？\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E你可以在 Poki 上免费玩 Guns Guns Guns。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\n\n\u003Ch3\u003E我可以在手机和电脑上玩《枪战枪战》吗？\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\n枪战枪战游戏可以在电脑和移动设备（如手机和平板电脑）上玩。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","meta":{"site_id":73,"title":"Guns Guns Guns - 免费在线玩! | Poki (宝玩)","description":"在最受欢迎的免费在线小游戏网站上玩Guns Guns Guns！Poki (宝玩)可在您的手机、平板电脑或电脑上运行。无需下载，无需登录。现在就玩！"},"file":{"content":"https:\u002F\u002Fgames.poki.com\u002F458768\u002F8440add7-d2ba-4096-a958-6c6bfe720434","orientation":"both","render_type":"unknown"},"mobile_file":{"content":"https:\u002F\u002Fgames.poki.com\u002F458768\u002F8440add7-d2ba-4096-a958-6c6bfe720434","orientation":"both","render_type":"unknown"},"content":"https:\u002F\u002Fgames.poki.com\u002F458768\u002F8440add7-d2ba-4096-a958-6c6bfe720434","orientation":"both","render_type":"unknown","breadcrumb":[{"id":903,"mobile":true,"slug":"跑步","title":"跑步游戏","short_title":"跑步","image":{"path":"424bbeb97e7687ce63fba810118db58c\u002F跑步-logo.png"},"image_url":"424bbeb97e7687ce63fba810118db58c\u002F跑步-logo.png","iab_categories":"IAB9,IAB17,IAB17-26,IAB9-30","category_type":"mechanic","game_count":59}],"breadcrumbs":[{"id":903,"mobile":true,"slug":"跑步","title":"跑步游戏","short_title":"跑步","image":{"path":"424bbeb97e7687ce63fba810118db58c\u002F跑步-logo.png"},"image_url":"424bbeb97e7687ce63fba810118db58c\u002F跑步-logo.png","iab_categories":"IAB9,IAB17,IAB17-26,IAB9-30","category_type":"mechanic","game_count":59}],"alternate_sites":{"ar":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"bg":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"bn":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"cs":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"da":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"de":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"el":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"en":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"es":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"fi":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"fr":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"he":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"hi":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"hu":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"id":{"slug":"guns-guns-guns","title":"Guns Guns Guns"},"it":{"slug":"guns-guns-gun