ass="okjidGhocmXN7zKxDo6s"><div id="gp_300x250" style="height: 250px; width: 300px; overflow: hidden;"></div></div><div class="ijT1oilby2WbYJUzfbaJ">广告</div></div></div><div class="yqRHsCZfzhtS8CI82MRw ZWzDTMK76w9X1iaBvoSs"><div class="pBveriWEDsb6AJVk59Ng"><div style="height: 600px; width: 160px; overflow: hidden;" class="okjidGhocmXN7zKxDo6s"><div id="gp_160x600" style="height: 600px; width: 160px; overflow: hidden;"></div></div><div class="ijT1oilby2WbYJUzfbaJ">广告</div></div></div></div><div style="display: contents;"><div id="game-description" class="SPLjvwUglljx72Cbc38U"><div class="gnTU2EC40IjqezF8mtia"><div class="faGITj9TBz9lF7f5QD7x"><figure class="OFjmSu01hMepf7DYV_tM"><picture class="HEphDnRJV3iA80Y1FG5e"><source srcSet="https://img.poki-cdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=78,scq=50,width=314,height=314,fit=cover,f=auto/70948c705d9f7443ed90498d6ac5bc50/guns-guns-guns-logo.png 1x, https://img.poki-cdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=78,scq=50,width=628,height=628,fit=cover,f=auto/70948c705d9f7443ed90498d6ac5bc50/guns-guns-guns-logo.png 2x" media="(min-width: 800px)" width="314" height="314" class="ZkjjJvdHN77mDHPbAqAe" /><img alt="Guns Guns Guns" src="https://img.poki-cdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=78,scq=50,width=94,height=94,fit=cover,f=auto/70948c705d9f7443ed90498d6ac5bc50/guns-guns-guns-logo.png" srcSet="https://img.poki-cdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=78,scq=50,width=94,height=94,fit=cover,f=auto/70948c705d9f7443ed90498d6ac5bc50/guns-guns-guns-logo.png 1x, https://img.poki-cdn.com/cdn-cgi/image/q=78,scq=50,width=188,height=188,fit=cover,f=auto/70948c705d9f7443ed90498d6ac5bc50/guns-guns-guns-logo.png 2x" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high" width="94" height="94" class="ZkjjJvdHN77mDHPbAqAe" /></picture><figcaption class="pkyQYZUaPcJ5T7YkBgYe"><nav class="kd9Is9cTBZ_vuww2pWiX"><div class="wpZ3GoxLQVMZwH0a4VbJ"><div class="ywoqqyUKAOhwkYT8pgAd"><a href="/zh">游戏</a></div><div class="ywoqqyUKAOhwkYT8pgAd"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-chevron-down" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-chevron-down.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye FzCrgTBdL_UGZ6dZa4R7"></span><a href="/zh/跑步">跑步游戏</a></div></div></nav><h1 class="TIakIJk_seZmjAw2Dhmw">Guns Guns Guns</h1><div class="JMcreCZt8qSHW4ejT2vM"><span>制作方: </span>CHEPERGame</div></figcaption></figure><div class="tFZVF03PQZaPOzLciiSJ"><div>Guns Guns Guns 是一款射击游戏，玩家置身于战术军事场景中。踏上战场，从逼真武器库中选择你的武器，与小队合作，在竞技场比赛中击败对手。</div><button type="button" class="buttonReset m82lRUpJLGRrwux8_eBE">查看更多<span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-plus" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-plus.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye"></span></button></div></div><div class="aYbRzQy1dkv5k0ahUrTx"><p>
《枪枪枪》是一款数字游戏，你的任务很简单——赚取更多金币，升级你的枪支！从基础装备开始，选择正确的路线来提升收入，并在每个关卡的最后消灭怪物。不断升级，不断射击，看着你的火力在每一轮都变得更强。准备好积累金币，打造终极武器库了吗？</p>

<h3>如何玩《枪枪枪》？</h3>
<p>
使用A/D键、左右方向键或摇杆移动。点击射击！</p>

<h3>谁创造了《枪枪枪》？</h3>
<p>
《枪枪枪》由 CHEPERGame 开发。玩玩他们的其他游戏吧！ Poki (宝玩)： <a onclick="window.navigateTo('/zh/g/elemental-master');return false;" href="https://poki.com/zh/g/elemental-master">Elemental Master</a>！</p>


<h3>如何免费玩《枪战枪战》？</h3>
<p>你可以在 Poki 上免费玩 Guns Guns Guns。</p>

<h3>我可以在手机和电脑上玩《枪战枪战》吗？</h3>
<p>
枪战枪战游戏可以在电脑和移动设备（如手机和平板电脑）上玩。</p></div></div><div class="gnTU2EC40IjqezF8mtia L2_WH8qwnlLKoltC4VDR"><ul class="Z7DT_mB2R6VWvdLiCfMW"><li class="kGgaXgO0yXnelvq8Y3Hw R0z1YfwIRDgkk8baNsbd"><div class="L1TFlm6IkmY7qyb5HRjp"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-star-filled" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-star-filled.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye zKViGp56WRLVtF8ND6Xd"></span></div><div class="roMzUgDy9WIDLLdpqCZg">评分</div><div class="Bp3YqeHZTp31GR5MQtEN">4.4</div></li><li class="kGgaXgO0yXnelvq8Y3Hw AkAOzOFTQDUloHVayVJM"><div class="L1TFlm6IkmY7qyb5HRjp"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-lightning" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-lightning.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye zKViGp56WRLVtF8ND6Xd"></span></div><div class="roMzUgDy9WIDLLdpqCZg">已更新</div><div class="Bp3YqeHZTp31GR5MQtEN">2026年4月</div></li></ul></div><div class="gnTU2EC40IjqezF8mtia kTngT1jPeeDVW_iVpBY3"><h2 class="mksXb8gjVNuyAlN4LgAP">关于此游戏</h2><ul class="ls7Q57iVJt400u5jthXr"><li class="S6UxDoNzkX4ZuUx7qmPq"><span class="_y5H6xC7p0G7OeZu54TP"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-device-scanning" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-device-scanning.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye ZfPBC5hXIpQLefXgh1Ap"></span><span class="XJ8BFNhAzfgqNHfNKsJp">支持的设备</span></span><div class="OnH32zdME8mMTJvgJkfm">电脑, 手机和平板</div></li><li class="S6UxDoNzkX4ZuUx7qmPq"><span class="_y5H6xC7p0G7OeZu54TP"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-code" style="--icon-src: url('https://a.poki-cdn.com/icons/ui-masks/ui-icons-code.svg');" class="kzPaMiKIK5c1hyP3aSiu AfaGcDcSKpA3JuDfG9Ye ZfPBC5hXIpQLefXgh1Ap"></span><span class="XJ8BFNhAzfgqNHfNKsJp">开发者</span></span><div class="OnH32zdME8mMTJvgJkfm">CHEPERGame</div></li><li class="S6UxDoNzkX4ZuUx7qmPq"><span class="_y5H6xC7p0G7OeZu54TP"><span role="img" aria-label="ui-icons-splice" style="--icon-src